sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant An as Business analyst
  participant UI as Rule Studio (App)
  participant LLM as Foundation Model API
  participant L as Lakebase
  participant S as Real-Time Mode stream

  An->>UI: "If a confirmed flight has no seat,<br/>call the seat-assignment service"
  UI->>LLM: system prompt + allowed fields/operators
  LLM-->>UI: name + JSON Logic + explanation
  UI->>UI: validate() — only known operators
  An->>UI: Preview
  UI->>L: last N change_events
  UI-->>An: "would have matched N of the recent versions" + samples
  An->>UI: Approve & activate
  UI->>L: INSERT rules (status = active)
  Note over S: RuleCache TTL 5 s
  S->>L: reload active rules
  S->>S: evaluate on every new version
  S->>L: rule_hits + action_outbox
  UI-->>An: hits counter climbs (measured 4.5 s after approval)
  Note over An,S: no code, no deploy, no stream restart
